Pi coding agent — example extensions
Upstream:  @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 0.84.4
Project:   https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Licence:   MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner

Redistributed verbatim from packages/coding-agent/examples/extensions/,
byte-identical apart from the provenance header each file carries:

  agent/extensions/preset.ts
  agent/extensions/questionnaire.ts
  agent/extensions/todo.ts
  agent/extensions/tools.ts
  agent/extensions/sandbox/index.ts
  agent/extensions/plan-mode/utils.ts

Modified, and how:

  agent/extensions/plan-mode/index.ts
      registers /plan-todos instead of /todos, because todo.ts owns /todos
      and the second registration would shadow it
      its injected plan-mode prompt points at the web_search tool instead of a
      "brave-search skill", which no version of this setup has ever installed

sandbox/index.ts is the only one with a dependency of its own,
@anthropic-ai/sandbox-runtime (Apache-2.0, Anthropic), declared in
agent/extensions/package.json and pinned at 0.0.75 rather than the 0.0.26 the
example pins: it is the component that does the containing, and being 49
releases behind on that is worse than diverging from the example. The three
entry points the file calls -- initialize, reset, wrapWithSandbox -- were
checked against 0.0.75 first.

